  <title>Invoice to payment matching</title>

  <p>Opened from the <link xref="contact_hub"/>, this window draws a
  customer's invoices in one column and their payments and credit memos in
  the other, each as tall as its amount, oldest at the top. Where an invoice
  lines up with a payment, the payment covered it; where the columns drift
  apart, something was paid short or not at all.</p>

  <p>Choose the <gui>Customer</gui>. Use the slider to zoom. Right click an
  invoice to open its <link xref="invoice_hub"/>, or a payment to see it in
  <link xref="payments_received"/>.</p>

</page>
